IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sfa-core`
IMPORT `sfac-240aa`

-- Tests for sfac-240aa.l4 (ss 240AA, 240AB, 240A). Every expected value is written from the text of the Act (SFA2001.txt lines 38829 to 39094) before the code was run.
-- The arguments of a call are in the order of the function's GIVEN; a comment above a group names them.

§ `s 240AA(1): the bar`
-- arguments: the person makes an offer; the securities offered are relevant (answer of s 240AA(5)); the offer is made in or with a prospectus or profile statement that complies with s 240; accompanied by a product highlights sheet; the sheet complies with the prescribed requirements; a copy is lodged; the person is exempt (answer of s 240AB(1) and (2)); this Subdivision applies (answer)
-- every limb of (a) and (b) met: "unless" is satisfied, the bar does not bite
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no sheet at all, and each limb missing in turn: the bar bites
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- no offer is made: the bar speaks of a person who makes an offer (SPLIT-SITE (i): NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the securities are not relevant securities: the bar is limited to relevant securities (SPLIT-SITE (i): NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the offer is not made in or with a prospectus or profile statement that complies with section 240: the bar is limited to such offers (SPLIT-SITE (i): NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the person is exempt under section 240AB
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the exemption is not shown (JUST FALSE or NOTHING): it is read as not shown, and the bar bites
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the person is exempt but makes no offer: the bar's own limit comes first
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the Subdivision does not apply to the offer
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an answer nobody has worked out is not turned into a yes or a no
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE NOTHING TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the sheet is there and in order: the bar is off whatever the unworked answers say
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(1) the person must not make the offer` TRUE NOTHING TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT BREACH: the bar bites and the person makes the offer
#TRACE (`s 240AA(1) the person shall not make the offer without a product highlights sheet` (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") (JUST TRUE)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") DOES `s 240AA(1) make the offer` AT 3

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL: the bar bites and nothing has yet been done
#TRACE (`s 240AA(1) the person shall not make the offer without a product highlights sheet` (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") (JUST TRUE)) AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED: the bar does not bite (the sheet is in order), so making the offer is no breach
#TRACE (`s 240AA(1) the person shall not make the offer without a product highlights sheet` (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") (JUST FALSE)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (`An offeror` "Acme Pte Ltd") DOES `s 240AA(1) make the offer` AT 3

§ `s 240AA(2): the bar on a document that resembles a product highlights sheet`
-- arguments: the person publishes or disseminates a document; the securities are relevant (answer); the document relates to an offer made in or with a prospectus or profile statement that complies with s 240; it resembles a product highlights sheet; required under written law or by a court in Singapore; required under foreign law or by a foreign court; required by listing rules; the person is exempt (answer); this Subdivision applies (answer)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "unless the person is required to do so", each of (a), (b), (c) in turn: the gate is closed
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the document does not resemble a product highlights sheet: "if the document resembles" is not met (SPLIT-SITE (i), reading (a): JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no publication, no relevant securities, no complying offer (SPLIT-SITE (i): NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the limits of the bar come before the "if": no relevant securities and no resemblance
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- exemption under section 240AB, and the Subdivision does not apply
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- unworked answers
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE NOTHING TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(2) the person must not publish or disseminate the document` TRUE NOTHING TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT BREACH: the bar bites and the person publishes the document
#TRACE (`s 240AA(2) the person shall not publish or disseminate the document` (Individual "Jo Tan") (JUST TRUE)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "Jo Tan") DOES `s 240AA(2) publish or disseminate the document` AT 2

-- EXPECT FULFILLED: the person is required by law to publish it, so the bar does not bite
#TRACE (`s 240AA(2) the person shall not publish or disseminate the document` (Individual "Jo Tan") (JUST FALSE)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "Jo Tan") DOES `s 240AA(2) publish or disseminate the document` AT 2

§ `s 240AA(3): the Authority may publish`
-- arguments: a product highlights sheet lodged under s 240AA; the English translation lodged under s 318A(1)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(3) the Authority may publish the document for public information` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(3) the Authority may publish the document for public information` FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(3) the Authority may publish the document for public information` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- any other document: the power is limited by its own object, so the text does not say (NOTHING), not that the Authority may not
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(3) the Authority may publish the document for public information` FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 240AA(4): the offence and its penalty`
-- arguments: the answer of s 240AA(1); the answer of s 240AA(2)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the person contravenes neither: the text names the person who contravenes and says nothing of anyone else (SPLIT-SITE (i): NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the penalty: a fine up to $50,000 or imprisonment up to 12 months or both; a further fine up to $5,000 a day
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`) EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the longest imprisonment, in months`) EQUALS 12
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the text allows both the fine and the imprisonment`) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(4) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the highest further fine for each day the offence continues, in Singapore dollars`) EQUALS 5000

§ `s 240AA(5): the definitions`
-- "asset-backed securities": the meaning of section 262(3), passed through
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "asset-backed securities" the securities are asset-backed securities` (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "asset-backed securities" the securities are asset-backed securities` (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "asset-backed securities" the securities are asset-backed securities` NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

-- "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts": asset-backed securities (answer); structured notes (answer); prescribed under s 341
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` NOTHING NOTHING TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "means" closes the list: neither, and nothing prescribed
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an answer nobody has worked out is not turned into a no
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` NOTHING (JUST FALSE) FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "relevant securities or securities-based derivatives contracts" the securities or contracts are relevant` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- "single purpose vehicle": an entity; a trust; (a) counterparty to the derivatives arrangements; (b) issue structured notes; established for no other purpose
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "either or both": both purposes
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "solely": a further purpose, or neither purpose, or neither an entity nor a trust
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "single purpose vehicle" the body is a single purpose vehicle` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "specified financial institution": a bank licensed under the Banking Act 1970; an entity; specified by the Authority in the Gazette
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "specified financial institution" the body is a specified financial institution` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "specified financial institution" the body is a specified financial institution` FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "specified financial institution" the body is a specified financial institution` FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "specified financial institution" the body is a specified financial institution` FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "synthetic securitisation transaction": the arrangement uses derivatives to create exposure; the assets are transferred to, or held in a pool by, a vehicle; the answer for that vehicle (single purpose vehicle)
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "synthetic securitisation transaction" the arrangement is a synthetic securitisation transaction` TRUE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "synthetic securitisation transaction" the arrangement is a synthetic securitisation transaction` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the assets sit in a single purpose vehicle: exposure to assets that ARE transferred to one is outside the definition
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "synthetic securitisation transaction" the arrangement is a synthetic securitisation transaction` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- no use of derivatives
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "synthetic securitisation transaction" the arrangement is a synthetic securitisation transaction` FALSE FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "synthetic securitisation transaction" the arrangement is a synthetic securitisation transaction` FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the vehicle's status was not worked out
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "synthetic securitisation transaction" the arrangement is a synthetic securitisation transaction` TRUE TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

-- "structured notes", the combiner: a debenture or unit of debentures; the answer of (a); the answer of (b); the answer of the formula tail
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` FALSE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE NOTHING (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
-- one limb answers JUST FALSE: no answer of another limb can lift it
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" the debentures or units of debentures are structured notes` TRUE NOTHING (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "structured notes" (a): issued in relation to a synthetic securitisation transaction (answer); in relation to another prescribed arrangement; by a specified financial institution (answer)
-- the raw text joins (A), (B) and (ii) with "or" (fork F21): any one is enough
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` (JUST TRUE) FALSE (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` (JUST TRUE) FALSE (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` (JUST FALSE) TRUE (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` (JUST FALSE) FALSE (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` NOTHING TRUE NOTHING) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- none of the three
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` (JUST FALSE) FALSE (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- unworked answers
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` NOTHING FALSE (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` (JUST FALSE) FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (a) the debentures are issued in relation to a transaction and by a specified financial institution` NOTHING FALSE NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING

-- "structured notes" (b): the principal sum is payable; any interest is payable; another prescribed sum is payable; underlying assets are physically delivered
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (iv): two or more of (i), (ii), (iii) apply
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- none of them
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" (b) the debentures carry a payment or delivery term` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- "structured notes", the formula: performance of securities etc; credit risk or performance of an entity; interest or exchange rates; other prescribed variables
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" in accordance with a formula based on one or more of the variables` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" in accordance with a formula based on one or more of the variables` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" in accordance with a formula based on one or more of the variables` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" in accordance with a formula based on one or more of the variables` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" in accordance with a formula based on one or more of the variables` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AA(5) "structured notes" in accordance with a formula based on one or more of the variables` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 240AB: exemption from the product highlights sheet requirement`
-- s 240AB(1) and (2): exempted by regulations (the person or a class to which the person belongs); exempted by written notice; the exemption extends to the requirement asked about
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(1) and (2) the person is exempt from the requirements in section 240AA` TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(1) and (2) the person is exempt from the requirements in section 240AA` FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(1) and (2) the person is exempt from the requirements in section 240AA` TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "all or any of the requirements": an exemption from one requirement is not an exemption from another (the text does not say the person is not exempt: NOTHING)
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(1) and (2) the person is exempt from the requirements in section 240AA` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- no exemption: the text says when the Authority may exempt and nothing of the person it has not exempted
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(1) and (2) the person is exempt from the requirements in section 240AA` FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240AB(3): the Authority imposed, added or varied the condition; the Authority has revoked it
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(3) the condition or restriction is in force` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(3) the condition or restriction is in force` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(3) the condition or restriction is in force` FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(3) the condition or restriction is in force` FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240AB(4): the exemption was granted under subsection (2)
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(4) it is necessary to publish the exemption in the Gazette` TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an exemption by regulations under subsection (1): the text does not say
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(4) it is necessary to publish the exemption in the Gazette` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240AB(5): the offence and its penalty
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(5) the person is guilty of an offence` TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(5) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(5) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the highest fine, in Singapore dollars`) EQUALS 50000
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(5) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the longest imprisonment, in months`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(5) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the text allows both the fine and the imprisonment`) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240AB(5) the penalty for the offence`'s `penalty: the highest further fine for each day the offence continues, in Singapore dollars`) EQUALS 5000

-- EXPECT BREACH: the condition is in force and the person contravenes it
#TRACE (`s 240AB(5) the person shall not contravene a condition or restriction` (Individual "Jo Tan") (JUST TRUE)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "Jo Tan") DOES `s 240AB(5) contravene the condition or restriction` AT 2

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL: the condition is in force and nothing has yet been done
#TRACE (`s 240AB(5) the person shall not contravene a condition or restriction` (Individual "Jo Tan") (JUST TRUE)) AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED: the condition was revoked, so acting against it is no breach
#TRACE (`s 240AB(5) the person shall not contravene a condition or restriction` (Individual "Jo Tan") (JUST FALSE)) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY (Individual "Jo Tan") DOES `s 240AB(5) contravene the condition or restriction` AT 2

§ `s 240A: debenture issuance programme`
-- s 240A(1): the offer is part of a debenture issuance programme; the prospectus comprises a base prospectus; it comprises a pricing statement
#ASSERT (`s 240A(1) the prospectus comprises what it must comprise` TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(1) the prospectus comprises what it must comprise` TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(1) the prospectus comprises what it must comprise` TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(1) the prospectus comprises what it must comprise` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not part of a programme: the duty is limited by its own wording
#ASSERT (`s 240A(1) the prospectus comprises what it must comprise` FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240A(1) the prospectus comprises what it must comprise` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240A(2): the same for a profile statement (a base profile statement; a pricing statement)
#ASSERT (`s 240A(2) the profile statement comprises what it must comprise` TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(2) the profile statement comprises what it must comprise` TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(2) the profile statement comprises what it must comprise` TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(2) the profile statement comprises what it must comprise` FALSE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240A(3): an offer referred to in subsection (1); the base prospectus lodged (signed); the pricing statement lodged (signed); both registered; lodged and registered as a single document
-- "either separately, whether on the same date or on different dates": the dates do not matter, so there is no date input
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "or as a single document"
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the "if" is not met (reading (a): JUST FALSE): a copy missing, or not registered
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not an offer referred to in subsection (1): the subsection is limited by its own wording
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 240A(3) the requirements of section 240(1)(a)(ii) and (iii) are satisfied for the offer` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240A(4): the same for a profile statement and the requirements of s 240(4)(b) and (c)
#ASSERT (`s 240A(4) the requirements of section 240(4)(b) and (c) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(4) the requirements of section 240(4)(b) and (c) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(4) the requirements of section 240(4)(b) and (c) are satisfied for the offer` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(4) the requirements of section 240(4)(b) and (c) are satisfied for the offer` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240A(5): the offer is under the programme; the base prospectus or base profile statement is lodged and registered
#ASSERT (`s 240A(5) the base prospectus or base profile statement is treated as lodged with and registered by the Authority for the offer` TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the "where" gate fails (the periods ruling, rule (b): JUST FALSE)
#ASSERT (`s 240A(5) the base prospectus or base profile statement is treated as lodged with and registered by the Authority for the offer` TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(5) the base prospectus or base profile statement is treated as lodged with and registered by the Authority for the offer` FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 240A(6): an offer referred to in subsection (1); the context otherwise requires; the Authority has prescribed otherwise
#ASSERT (`s 240A(6) a reference to a prospectus is read as a reference to both the base prospectus and the pricing statement` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(6) a reference to a prospectus is read as a reference to both the base prospectus and the pricing statement` TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(6) a reference to a prospectus is read as a reference to both the base prospectus and the pricing statement` TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(6) a reference to a prospectus is read as a reference to both the base prospectus and the pricing statement` TRUE TRUE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(6) a reference to a prospectus is read as a reference to both the base prospectus and the pricing statement` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240A(7): the same for a reference to a profile statement, for an offer referred to in subsection (2)
#ASSERT (`s 240A(7) a reference to a profile statement is read as a reference to both the base profile statement and the pricing statement` TRUE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(7) a reference to a profile statement is read as a reference to both the base profile statement and the pricing statement` TRUE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(7) a reference to a profile statement is read as a reference to both the base profile statement and the pricing statement` TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(7) a reference to a profile statement is read as a reference to both the base profile statement and the pricing statement` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 240A(9): "at any time after its lodgment": the date the pricing statement is lodged; the day registration is asked about
#ASSERT (`s 240A(9) the Authority may register the pricing statement on the day` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 2 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(9) the Authority may register the pricing statement on the day` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(9) the Authority may register the pricing statement on the day` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 28 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 240A(9) the Authority may register the pricing statement on the day` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 1 3 2027)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
